<tr><td>June 12, 2025</td><td>Training thunderstorms produced 3 to 8 inches of rain across San Antonio; deadly flooding along Beitel Creek; nine homes reported flooded along Shin Oak Dr. in Live Oak</td><td><a href="https://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/stormevents/eventdetails.jsp?id=1272324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View</a></td></tr>
